iCloud Calendar (CalDAV) for Home Assistant
Copyright 2026 tomek7667

This integration is derived from the CalDAV integration of Home Assistant
(https://github.com/home-assistant/core, homeassistant/components/caldav),
Copyright Home Assistant contributors, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Changes: event updating and deleting (single events, one occurrence of a
recurring series, an occurrence and all after it, a whole series), lookup of
calendar objects without a UID REPORT, read-only calendar detection, copying
the account from an existing CalDAV entry, and removal of YAML configuration.
